1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:05,500
A dark, rocky wasteland stretches toward a distant ridge. Above it, a brilliant teal nebula and a small red moon illuminate the starry sky.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:09,000
A colony ship streaks down from the upper left, a brilliant point of white light trailing across the heavens.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,693
It descends toward the lifeless terrain, bringing the first spark of movement to a barren world.
